{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01RKcEu4CYYQsdveLxX3p7UH","type":"tool_result","content":"4970:### interface TransitionOptions\n4971-\n4972-- `duration?: number`: Seconds (real time). Default 0.45.\n4973-- `color?: ScreenColor`: Colour it covers with. Default ink (palette black).\n4974-- `center?: Vector3 | readonly [number, number]`: Where an iris closes / a shockwave starts: a world point (a Vector3 is followed while it moves), or `[u, v]` on the screen (0..1 from the top-lef\n4975-\n4976-### TRANSITIONS\n4977-\n4978-```ts\n4979-const TRANSITIONS: readonly TransitionKind[]\n4980-```\n4689:### class ScreenFx\n4690-\n4691-- `cover(kind: TransitionKind = 'fade', o: TransitionOptions = {}): Promise<boolean>`: Cover the picture (progress → 1). Resolves when it stops: `true` when it is fully covered, `false` when anot\n4692-- `reveal(kind?: TransitionKind, o: TransitionOptions = {}): Promise<boolean>`: Uncover it (progress → 0) with `kind` (default: the one that covered it). Resolves like `cover`.\n4693-- `transition(kind: TransitionKind, between: () => unknown, o: TransitionOptions & { revealCenter?: TransitionOptions['center'] } = {}): Promise<boolean>`: Cover, run `between` (load a level, tel\n4694-- `set(kind: TransitionKind | null, progress: number): void`: Jump straight to a progress (0 clear, 1 covered), no animation.\n4695-- `flash(color: ScreenColor = 'white', o: FlashOptions = {}): void`: A full-screen flash that fades out.\n4696-- `shockwave(at: Vector3 | readonly [number, number], o: ShockwaveOptions = {}): void`: A ring that pushes the picture outwards from `at` (oldest ring is replaced when 4 run).\n4697-- `clear(): void`: Stop everything (a clear picture).\n4698-- `state(): ScreenFxState`\n4699-- `update(dt: number, camera: Camera | null): void`: Engine, every rendered frame (real seconds; `camera` projects world centres).\n4700-- `sampleNode(tex: any, scale: any): any`: Sample an art-resolution picture for the device pass, pushed by the shockwaves and blocked up by a mosaic transition, with the rings' bright edge. `tex`\n4701-- `colorNode(color: any, scale: any): any`: The transition and the flash over a finished colour (device pass).\n4702-\n4703-### interface ScreenFxState\n4704-\n4705-What `state()` reports (tests, tools).\n4706-\n4707-- `transition: TransitionKind | null`\n4708-- `progress: number`: 0 clear … 1 covered.\n4709-- `moving: boolean`: A transition is animating.\n8:import { Hud } from './hud/Hud';\n45:    /** Pixel HUD text and icons in art pixels (src/engine/hud). */\n46:    readonly hud: Hud;\n203:/** `Engine.headless`: the page's options (those about the page do nothing), and where it runs. */\n249:    readonly hud: Hud;\n323:     * The page's renderer, for direct GPU work (readbacks, the canvas, compute): null headless\n324:     * (`Engine.headless`), where nothing is drawn. Gameplay reads `renderer`, which both have.\n382:     * The engine without a page (docs/engine/headless.md): the same boot, game code and frames as\n390:    static headless(game: Game, options?: HeadlessOptions): Promise<Engine>;\n391:    /** The one boot sequence of `start` and `headless`: only the view and the page's parts differ. */\n5: * **transitions** that cover the picture in art-pixel patterns, a **flash**, and up to four\n9: *   await engine.screen.cover('iris', { center: hero.position });   // closes on the hero\n11: *   await engine.screen.reveal('iris');\n39:    /** Colour it covers with. Default ink (palette black). */\n64:    /** 0 clear … 1 covered. */\n103:     * Cover the picture (progress → 1). Resolves when it stops: `true` when it is fully covered,\n106:    cover(kind?: TransitionKind, o?: TransitionOptions): Promise<boolean>;\n107:    /** Uncover it (progress → 0) with `kind` (default: the one that covered it). Resolves like `cover`. */\n108:    reveal(kind?: TransitionKind, o?: TransitionOptions): Promise<boolean>;\n110:     * Cover, run `between` (load a level, teleport), then reveal, also when `between` throws","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a4cb4937-9264-42cc-b44d-b76eca04b6e6","uuid":"fb785544-d978-4451-b9d7-d1accf9a3bcb","timestamp":"2026-11-06T00:47:53.261Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"4970:### interface TransitionOptions\n4971-\n4972-- `duration?: number`: Seconds (real time). Default 0.45.\n4973-- `color?: ScreenColor`: Colour it covers with. Default ink (palette black).\n4974-- `center?: Vector3 | readonly [number, number]`: Where an iris closes / a shockwave starts: a world point (a Vector3 is followed while it moves), or `[u, v]` on the screen (0..1 from the top-lef\n4975-\n4976-### TRANSITIONS\n4977-\n4978-```ts\n4979-const TRANSITIONS: readonly TransitionKind[]\n4980-```\n4689:### class ScreenFx\n4690-\n4691-- `cover(kind: TransitionKind = 'fade', o: TransitionOptions = {}): Promise<boolean>`: Cover the picture (progress → 1). Resolves when it stops: `true` when it is fully covered, `false` when anot\n4692-- `reveal(kind?: TransitionKind, o: TransitionOptions = {}): Promise<boolean>`: Uncover it (progress → 0) with `kind` (default: the one that covered it). Resolves like `cover`.\n4693-- `transition(kind: TransitionKind, between: () => unknown, o: TransitionOptions & { revealCenter?: TransitionOptions['center'] } = {}): Promise<boolean>`: Cover, run `between` (load a level, tel\n4694-- `set(kind: TransitionKind | null, progress: number): void`: Jump straight to a progress (0 clear, 1 covered), no animation.\n4695-- `flash(color: ScreenColor = 'white', o: FlashOptions = {}): void`: A full-screen flash that fades out.\n4696-- `shockwave(at: Vector3 | readonly [number, number], o: ShockwaveOptions = {}): void`: A ring that pushes the picture outwards from `at` (oldest ring is replaced when 4 run).\n4697-- `clear(): void`: Stop everything (a clear picture).\n4698-- `state(): ScreenFxState`\n4699-- `update(dt: number, camera: Camera | null): void`: Engine, every rendered frame (real seconds; `camera` projects world centres).\n4700-- `sampleNode(tex: any, scale: any): any`: Sample an art-resolution picture for the device pass, pushed by the shockwaves and blocked up by a mosaic transition, with the rings' bright edge. `tex`\n4701-- `colorNode(color: any, scale: any): any`: The transition and the flash over a finished colour (device pass).\n4702-\n4703-### interface ScreenFxState\n4704-\n4705-What `state()` reports (tests, tools).\n4706-\n4707-- `transition: TransitionKind | null`\n4708-- `progress: number`: 0 clear … 1 covered.\n4709-- `moving: boolean`: A transition is animating.\n8:import { Hud } from './hud/Hud';\n45:    /** Pixel HUD text and icons in art pixels (src/engine/hud). */\n46:    readonly hud: Hud;\n203:/** `Engine.headless`: the page's options (those about the page do nothing), and where it runs. */\n249:    readonly hud: Hud;\n323:     * The page's renderer, for direct GPU work (readbacks, the canvas, compute): null headless\n324:     * (`Engine.headless`), where nothing is drawn. Gameplay reads `renderer`, which both have.\n382:     * The engine without a page (docs/engine/headless.md): the same boot, game code and frames as\n390:    static headless(game: Game, options?: HeadlessOptions): Promise<Engine>;\n391:    /** The one boot sequence of `start` and `headless`: only the view and the page's parts differ. */\n5: * **transitions** that cover the picture in art-pixel patterns, a **flash**, and up to four\n9: *   await engine.screen.cover('iris', { center: hero.position });   // closes on the hero\n11: *   await engine.screen.reveal('iris');\n39:    /** Colour it covers with. Default ink (palette black). */\n64:    /** 0 clear … 1 covered. */\n103:     * Cover the picture (progress → 1). Resolves when it stops: `true` when it is fully covered,\n106:    cover(kind?: TransitionKind, o?: TransitionOptions): Promise<boolean>;\n107:    /** Uncover it (progress → 0) with `kind` (default: the one that covered it). Resolves like `cover`. */\n108:    reveal(kind?: TransitionKind, o?: TransitionOptions): Promise<boolean>;\n110:     * Cover, run `between` (load a level, teleport), then reveal, also when `between` throws","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01RKcEu4CYYQsdveLxX3p7UH","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
