{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SDGEbKBpEQhWdVxC3Xs5d1","type":"tool_result","content":"4049\t### interface CameraKey\n4050\t\n4051\t- `at: number`: Time (s) the camera is exactly here.\n4052\t- `position: V3`\n4053\t- `target: V3`: The point it looks at.\n4054\t- `fov?: number`: Vertical field of view (degrees); default the previous key's, or 50.\n4055\t- `cut?: boolean`: Jump here instead of gliding from the key before (a cut to a new shot).\n4056\t\n4057\t### class CameraShake\n4058\t\n4059\t- `trauma: number`\n4060\t- `maxOffset: number`: World units at full trauma.\n4061\t- `decay: number`: Trauma lost per second.\n4062\t- `strength: number`: Global multiplier (settings: 0 turns shake off).\n4063\t- `readonly offset: Vector3`\n4064\t- `state(): ShakeState`: Trauma and the noise clock, as data (`engine.snapshot()`): what the next frames shake by follows from them.\n4065\t- `setState(s: ShakeState): void`\n4066\t- `add(amount: number): void`\n4067\t- `update(dt: number): Vector3`: Advance and compute `offset`.\n4068\t- `apply(rig: { readonly focus: Vector3 }, dt: number): void`: Update and move a camera rig's focus by the change in offset since the last call.\n4069\t- `reset(): void`\n4070\t\n4071\t### interface CameraShot\n4072\t\n4073\t- `position: [number, number, number]`\n4074\t- `target: [number, number, number]`\n4075\t- `fov: number`\n4076\t\n4077\t### interface ClockState\n4078\t\n4079\tA clock as data.\n4080\t\n4081\t- `readonly scale: number`\n4082\t- `readonly hitstop: number`\n4083\t\n4084\t### coversPixel()"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a4cb4937-9264-42cc-b44d-b76eca04b6e6","uuid":"04516a8f-03d4-4049-872b-8f10b3ddbd48","timestamp":"2026-11-06T02:35:36.259Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-171818__x10629c/work/HonkIfYouOwe-AnimalCrossingCityFolk-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261105-171818/kit/API.md","content":"### interface CameraKey\n\n- `at: number`: Time (s) the camera is exactly here.\n- `position: V3`\n- `target: V3`: The point it looks at.\n- `fov?: number`: Vertical field of view (degrees); default the previous key's, or 50.\n- `cut?: boolean`: Jump here instead of gliding from the key before (a cut to a new shot).\n\n### class CameraShake\n\n- `trauma: number`\n- `maxOffset: number`: World units at full trauma.\n- `decay: number`: Trauma lost per second.\n- `strength: number`: Global multiplier (settings: 0 turns shake off).\n- `readonly offset: Vector3`\n- `state(): ShakeState`: Trauma and the noise clock, as data (`engine.snapshot()`): what the next frames shake by follows from them.\n- `setState(s: ShakeState): void`\n- `add(amount: number): void`\n- `update(dt: number): Vector3`: Advance and compute `offset`.\n- `apply(rig: { readonly focus: Vector3 }, dt: number): void`: Update and move a camera rig's focus by the change in offset since the last call.\n- `reset(): void`\n\n### interface CameraShot\n\n- `position: [number, number, number]`\n- `target: [number, number, number]`\n- `fov: number`\n\n### interface ClockState\n\nA clock as data.\n\n- `readonly scale: number`\n- `readonly hitstop: number`\n\n### coversPixel()","numLines":36,"startLine":4049,"totalLines":5144}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01SDGEbKBpEQhWdVxC3Xs5d1","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
