{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NvNPnSwnyLvLAq713nqrHh","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# PROGRESS\n2\tTitle (RNG-picked): **Honk If You Owe**. Currency Beans. Town name is player-chosen.\n3\tDev folder: HonkIfYouOwe-AnimalCrossingCityFolk-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261105-171818 (cwd for all commands)\n4\tDeliverable: ../HonkIfYouOwe-AnimalCrossingCityFolk-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261105-171818.html + ../exit-interview.json (built by `node tools/build.mjs`)\n5\tPLAN.md + TASK.md are in ../ ; re-read the relevant section of PLAN.md when starting a system.\n6\t\n7\t## Architecture decisions\n8\t- src/game.js: one Game object `HonkGame`; `g` passed everywhere. world = plain JSON save (core/save.js).\n9\t- Places: town/city/rooms have local coords, actors parented to place.group. Generators drive cutscenes (systems/script.js).\n10\t- UI: ui/ui.js screen stack, Menu class; ui/dialogue.js; ui/input.js GameInput (g.inp); ui/draw.js panel etc; art/icons.js drawIcon.\n11\t- Art: art/critter.js (critterDef, CRITTERS, avatarDef), art/models.js (MODELS catalog, OWN_MODELS), art/textures.js; actors/rig.js Actor; actors/clips.js 48 clips.\n12\t- Data: data/{fish,bugs,fossils,art,furniture,clothes,items,town,townMap}.js. tools/genmap.mjs made townMap.js.\n13\t- tools/modelcheck.mjs, tools/clipcheck.mjs = quick validators.\n14\t\n15\t## Status (build order per PLAN §23)\n16\t- [x] Kit + hub downloaded (kit/, vendor/session.js, tests/hub/)\n17\t- [x] All first-pass modules written. tests/play: bot.mjs, playthrough.mjs (1-2), part2.mjs (3-6), part3.mjs (7-13) via try1.mjs: all passing. NEXT: net/ (hub round, Visit: visitUi.js and hubStart.js are placeholders to replace), tests/run.mjs + sim/browser/hub/visit suites, polish+visual review, About feedback, exit-interview.json\n18\t- [x] net/arena.js (Bean Bazaar), net/hubStart.js, tests/hub/run_hub.py (players=2 passes). In progress: Visit (net/visit.js, visitUi.js placeholder).\n19\t- [x] net/visit.js + visitUi.js written (BroadcastChannel + RTC). Need visit test suite.\n20\t- tests/run.mjs + sim + play (with replay) + hub + visit pass. NEXT: browser suite, sheets; visual review pass (shots/); About feedback text; exit-interview.json; cleanup (grep TODO, await_bus hack in attract.js).\n21\t- browser suite passes (112). POLISH BATCH in progress: wall offset, dim rooms, occluder rim, hourly specials/bugs, natural-day season page, umbrella+puddles, frosted windows, town footsteps, timeFrozen, starter bed, jar interest, mail flag, cheese smell, store door chime, pattern kit (tile/sign), Nib tail SpringChain, dust stomp, attract long-run test. THEN: About feedback + exit-interview.json, final run.\n22\t- polish batch done; About feedback + exit interview written (tools/exit_interview.mjs from src/data/about.js). NEXT: final full `node tests/run.mjs` (takes ~15 min, run in background), cleanup, final reply with Source Info + feedback.\n23\t- Full run started in background writing shots/full_run.log. After it: rebuild (src changed: flick once, HUD idle, licences all pages, fish rings, new-arrival footer, dissolve 0.72), rerun browser+play quickly, cleanup shots/, exit interview regenerate, final reply.\n24\t- DONE: final full run passed. Deliverables in place. Only the final reply remains.\n25\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a4cb4937-9264-42cc-b44d-b76eca04b6e6","uuid":"07fb9b41-f443-465c-92c3-0e8141ef8a6d","timestamp":"2026-11-06T02:48:44.794Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-171818__x10629c/work/PROGRESS.md","content":"# PROGRESS\nTitle (RNG-picked): **Honk If You Owe**. Currency Beans. Town name is player-chosen.\nDev folder: HonkIfYouOwe-AnimalCrossingCityFolk-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261105-171818 (cwd for all commands)\nDeliverable: ../HonkIfYouOwe-AnimalCrossingCityFolk-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261105-171818.html + ../exit-interview.json (built by `node tools/build.mjs`)\nPLAN.md + TASK.md are in ../ ; re-read the relevant section of PLAN.md when starting a system.\n\n## Architecture decisions\n- src/game.js: one Game object `HonkGame`; `g` passed everywhere. world = plain JSON save (core/save.js).\n- Places: town/city/rooms have local coords, actors parented to place.group. Generators drive cutscenes (systems/script.js).\n- UI: ui/ui.js screen stack, Menu class; ui/dialogue.js; ui/input.js GameInput (g.inp); ui/draw.js panel etc; art/icons.js drawIcon.\n- Art: art/critter.js (critterDef, CRITTERS, avatarDef), art/models.js (MODELS catalog, OWN_MODELS), art/textures.js; actors/rig.js Actor; actors/clips.js 48 clips.\n- Data: data/{fish,bugs,fossils,art,furniture,clothes,items,town,townMap}.js. tools/genmap.mjs made townMap.js.\n- tools/modelcheck.mjs, tools/clipcheck.mjs = quick validators.\n\n## Status (build order per PLAN §23)\n- [x] Kit + hub downloaded (kit/, vendor/session.js, tests/hub/)\n- [x] All first-pass modules written. tests/play: bot.mjs, playthrough.mjs (1-2), part2.mjs (3-6), part3.mjs (7-13) via try1.mjs: all passing. NEXT: net/ (hub round, Visit: visitUi.js and hubStart.js are placeholders to replace), tests/run.mjs + sim/browser/hub/visit suites, polish+visual review, About feedback, exit-interview.json\n- [x] net/arena.js (Bean Bazaar), net/hubStart.js, tests/hub/run_hub.py (players=2 passes). In progress: Visit (net/visit.js, visitUi.js placeholder).\n- [x] net/visit.js + visitUi.js written (BroadcastChannel + RTC). Need visit test suite.\n- tests/run.mjs + sim + play (with replay) + hub + visit pass. NEXT: browser suite, sheets; visual review pass (shots/); About feedback text; exit-interview.json; cleanup (grep TODO, await_bus hack in attract.js).\n- browser suite passes (112). POLISH BATCH in progress: wall offset, dim rooms, occluder rim, hourly specials/bugs, natural-day season page, umbrella+puddles, frosted windows, town footsteps, timeFrozen, starter bed, jar interest, mail flag, cheese smell, store door chime, pattern kit (tile/sign), Nib tail SpringChain, dust stomp, attract long-run test. THEN: About feedback + exit-interview.json, final run.\n- polish batch done; About feedback + exit interview written (tools/exit_interview.mjs from src/data/about.js). NEXT: final full `node tests/run.mjs` (takes ~15 min, run in background), cleanup, final reply with Source Info + feedback.\n- Full run started in background writing shots/full_run.log. After it: rebuild (src changed: flick once, HUD idle, licences all pages, fish rings, new-arrival footer, dissolve 0.72), rerun browser+play quickly, cleanup shots/, exit interview regenerate, final reply.\n- DONE: final full run passed. Deliverables in place. Only the final reply remains.\n","numLines":25,"startLine":1,"totalLines":25}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01NvNPnSwnyLvLAq713nqrHh","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
